B.br6=s(["Yon l\xf2t moun modifye sal la. Lis la pral rafrechi; verifye li anvan ou eseye ank\xf2.","La salle a \xe9t\xe9 modifi\xe9e ailleurs. La liste va \xeatre actualis\xe9e ; v\xe9rifiez-la avant de r\xe9essayer.","The gym was changed elsewhere. The list will refresh; review it before trying again."],t.s)
