B.bzL=s(["Nou mete dat fen ab\xf2nman an sou W2 a. Li ouvri pou moun ki peye, epi li refize moun ki pa peye li menm \u2014 menm si laptop la etenn.","La date de fin est envoy\xe9e au W2. Il ouvre aux membres \xe0 jour et refuse les impay\xe9s lui-m\xeame, m\xeame PC \xe9teint.","The end date is sent to the W2. It opens for paid members and refuses unpaid ones by itself, even with the PC off."],t.s)
